OL,3,GNEWSADad 'held falling lamp' during his
OL,4,Awife's labour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new father said he had to hold up a
OL,7,Flight that had fallen from the
OL,8,Fmaternity ward ceiling while his baby
OL,9,Fwas being born below.
OL,11,FJules Wilkinson said the lamp "started
OL,12,Fto unscrew itself" at Stepping Hill
OL,13,FHospital in Stockport, Greater
OL,14,FManchester, while his wife Lisa was in
OL,15,Flabour.
OL,17,FThe hospital's chief executive said
OL,18,FStepping Hill needed "at least #400m"
OL,19,Fto address building issues while
OL,20,FCheadle MP Tom Morrison said he was
OL,21,Fraising the matter in Parliament.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
